# Keep our organized directories:
# results/          <- KEEP (organized plots)
# figures/          <- KEEP (publication figures)
# simulations/      <- KEEP (input decks when added)
# sde/              <- KEEP (structure files when added)
# sdevice/          <- KEEP (simulation files when added)
# parameter/        <- KEEP (parameter files when added)
# analysis/         <- KEEP (scripts when added)
# documents/        <- KEEP (docs when added)